    "created_at": "2019-08-21T01:33:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-08-21T01:33:35Z",
    "body": "Alright, let's try a hotfix.\r\n\r\nRun `starship init zsh --print-full-init > test_init.sh`\r\n\r\nThen open `test_init.sh` in your favorite editor.\r\n\r\nReplace the line that says `if [[ $STARSHIP_START_TIME ]]; then` with `if [ ! -z \"${STARSHIP_START_TIME+1}\" ]; then`\r\n\r\nSave the file, then run `source test_init.sh`.\r\n\r\nDoes Starship work if you do this?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
